          "char_fairy_cang_yu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He Feng Yang spends over ten beads of green grape immortal essence and uses Expand Space Immortal Gu as the core of immortal killer move force intrusion, breaking space open into Hu Immortal blessed land.",
        "chapters": [
          699
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
